        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we launched a new direct‑to‑consumer product with free and paid tiers designed to expand our presence in the consumer market and deliver more comprehensive services across a wider range of customer needs.",
        "start_character": 42670,
        "end_character": 42883
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001552033-26-000012",
