        "accession_number": "0001552033-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In all business segments, we develop and maintain software applications that we use to deliver services to our customers, through a software-as-a-service model.",
        "start_character": 67799,
        "end_character": 67959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001552033-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001552033-26-000012-4ba86016770edb4c",
        "accession_number": "0001552033-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we develop and maintain analytics and technology solutions infrastructure that we host and make available for our customers to develop and deploy analytics to improve business performance.",
        "start_character": 67960,
        "end_character": 68163
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001552033-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001552033-26-000012-4ba86016770edb4c",
        "accession_number": "0001552033-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Once we establish a foothold in a region, our model involves expanding our service offerings within these markets and moving into adjacent emerging markets.",
        "start_character": 34567,
        "end_character": 34723
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001552033-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001552033-26-000012-4ba86016770edb4c",
        "accession_number": "0001552033-26-000012",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our benefit offerings are designed to meet the various and evolving needs of our workforce tailored to the businesses and geographies in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 94730,
        "end_character": 94884
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001552033-26-000012",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001552033-26-000012-4ba86016770edb4c",
